n把破碎的心 再次 钉在 荒野之上\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Chorus]\n可世界 偏要把我 从黑暗中 拖回现场\n冰冷的器械 撕裂了 最后的伪装\n我听见 救护车 划破寂静的 疯狂\n为什么 连绝望 都要被 强行埋葬\n我醒在 刺眼的白光里 满目荒凉\n\n[Outro]\n夜晚 还没 结束\n我 却 已经 归来\n只剩 呼吸\n在 空荡的 房间 徘徊                    ", "Melancholic Alt-Pop, Emo Rock, Dark Atmospheric, Piano Ballad, Distorted Electric Guitar, Emotional Male Vocals, Cinematic, Heartbreaking, Slow Tempo, Heavy Reverb", "RL-oss-3B-20260123", "oss-20260123", 655728426460529, "randomize", 240, 50, 1.0000000000000002, 1.5, true, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 18, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "link": 17, "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "version"}, "name": "version", "label": "version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "version"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec_version"}, "name": "codec_version", "label": "codec_version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "codec_version"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_audio_length_seconds"}, "name": "max_audio_length_seconds", "label": "max_audio_length_seconds", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_audio_length_seconds"}, {"widget": {"name": "topk"}, "name": "topk", "label": "topk", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "topk"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "offload_mode"}, "name": "offload_mode", "label": "offload_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "offload_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantize_